Licence note on the `arma-rs` dependency
----------------------------------------
`arma-rs` 1.13.0 declares `license = "MIT"` in its crate `Cargo.toml`, while
its upstream repository carries the GNU General Public License v2 as its
`LICENSE` file.  The crate metadata and the repository licence therefore
disagree.  This crate links `arma-rs` as an ordinary dependency and vendors
none of its source.  The discrepancy is recorded here and in the evidence
log; resolve it against the licence register before any public distribution.
